sequenceDiagram
  participant N as krbd on host N (new)
  participant H as rbd_header on the OSD
  participant O as current owner (host O)
  participant M as mon
  N->>H: cls lock exclusive with cookie "auto N"
  H-->>N: EBUSY
  N->>H: get_lock_owner_info and list_watchers
  alt the owner has a live watcher
    N->>O: notify REQUEST_LOCK (timeout 5 s)
    O-->>N: ack, then release the lock after flush
    Note over N: if not released, retry after 2 × 5 s
    N->>H: lock exclusive
    H-->>N: OK
  else the owner has no watcher
    N->>M: blocklist add the owner address
    M-->>N: OK
    N->>H: break_lock of the previous owner
    N->>H: lock exclusive
    H-->>N: OK
  end
